 xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-2-Title\">[a]=[b].</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-5B\" d=\"M118 -250V750H255V710H158V-210H255V-250H118Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-61\" d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157ZM351 328Q351 334 346 350T323 385T277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q217 26 254 59T298 110Q300 114 325 217T351 328Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-5D\" d=\"M22 710V750H159V-250H22V-210H119V710H22Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-3D\" d=\"M56 347Q56 360 70 367H707Q722 359 722 347Q722 336 708 328L390 327H72Q56 332 56 347ZM56 153Q56 168 72 173H708Q722 163 722 153Q722 140 707 133H70Q56 140 56 153Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMATHI-62\" d=\"M73 647Q73 657 77 670T89 683Q90 683 161 688T234 694Q246 694 246 685T212 542Q204 508 195 472T180 418L176 399Q176 396 182 402Q231 442 283 442Q345 442 383 396T422 280Q422 169 343 79T173 -11Q123 -11 82 27T40 150V159Q40 180 48 217T97 414Q147 611 147 623T109 637Q104 637 101 637H96Q86 637 83 637T76 640T73 647ZM336 325V331Q336 405 275 405Q258 405 240 397T207 376T181 352T163 330L157 322L136 236Q114 150 114 114Q114 66 138 42Q154 26 178 26Q211 26 245 58Q270 81 285 114T318 219Q336 291 336 325Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E2-MJMAIN-2E\" d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-5B\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-61\" x=\"278\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-5D\" x=\"808\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-3D\" x=\"1364\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-5B\" x=\"2420\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMATHI-62\" x=\"2699\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-5D\" x=\"3128\" y=\"0\"></use>\n <use xlink:href=\"#E2-MJMAIN-2E\" x=\"3407\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> This allows us to pick any element of a class as its representative.</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>On the other hand, two distinct equivalence classes have an empty intersection: \n<span class=\"mjpage mjpage__block\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"31.37ex\" height=\"2.843ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.838ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 13506.6 1223.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-3-Title\"> \na \\not\\sim b\n\\qquad\\Longrightarrow\\qquad\n[a] \\cap [b] = \\emptyset\n</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJMATHI-61\" d=\"M33 157Q33 258 109 349T280 441Q331 441 370 392Q386 422 416 422Q429 422 439 414T449 394Q449 381 412 234T374 68Q374 43 381 35T402 26Q411 27 422 35Q443 55 463 131Q469 151 473 152Q475 153 483 153H487Q506 153 506 144Q506 138 501 117T481 63T449 13Q436 0 417 -8Q409 -10 393 -10Q359 -10 336 5T306 36L300 51Q299 52 296 50Q294 48 292 46Q233 -10 172 -10Q117 -10 75 30T33 157ZM351 328Q351 334 346 350T323 385T277 405Q242 405 210 374T160 293Q131 214 119 129Q119 126 119 118T118 106Q118 61 136 44T179 26Q217 26 254 59T298 110Q300 114 325 217T351 328Z\"></path>\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E3-MJAMS-2241\" d=\"M220 366Q258 366 297 347T361 308T391 288Q394 288 464 370Q494 407 510 425T535 454T546 465T552 467H553Q560 467 566 461T573 448Q573 439 499 350Q424 266 424 261Q424 259 442 247T492 222T554 209Q607 209 6